==Trivia==
* This song along with [[Halo]] was used as an opening during a span of 20 episodes, the shortest for any original song in {{aniseries|PTS}} (that is, without counting remixes of different songs).
* This is the only opening theme in ''[[Pokémon the Series: Black & White]]'' that is not sung by [[Rica Matsumoto]].
